    "text": {
     "en": "A 5 × 15 arrangement means 5 rows of 15 pebbles.\nSplit 15 into 10 and 5: 5 × 10 = 50 and 5 × 5 = 25. Add them: 75.\nThis is the splitting method: break a bigger number into easy parts.\nBuild the table of 15 by adding 15 each time: 15, 30, 45, 60, 75."
